{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09991","headline":"长门怨 · 梁鍠","name":"长门怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾命何偏薄，君王去不归。\n欲令遥见悔，楼上试春衣。\n空殿看人入，深宫羡鸟飞。\n翻悲因买赋，索镜照空辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁鍠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}